      "rules": ["Names and descriptions are nonempty strings. List fields contain strings.", "defaultArms.control/test retain matching id, nonempty label/context and mustRecord arrays. Control has mustNotUse and test has mustUse arrays.", "All four publicSafety properties remain true. Runtime support, report sections and judge supported agents remain structured configuration.", "The bundled contract.json defines benchmark behaviour. Conversion preserves every property except the schema identifier."],
